        },
        {
          "text": " Kandi yaabaija ekyoterero ky'obubaane omu munyinya, oburaingwa bwakyo mukono gumwe, n'obuhango bwakyo mukono gumwe, kyaingaingana embaju zoona; kandi obwemi bwakyo bwaba mikono ebiri; amahembe gaakyo gaabaijeranwa nakyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.37.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.37.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
