          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 37:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaakishweka n'ezaabu eshemeziibwe, aha mutwe gwakyo n'embaju zaakyo n'amahembe gaakyo; kandi yaakitaho omuguno gw'ezaabu kukyehinguririza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.37.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.37.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 37:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaakiheeshera ebifunga bibiri by'ezaabu, yaabita ahansi y'omuguno gwakyo aha mbaju zaakyo zombi, kuba eby'okutamu emigamba y'okukiheekyesa; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.37.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.37.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 37:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "egyo migamba yaagikora omu munyinya, yaagishweka n'ezaabu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
